                      "content": "4 glyphs (held ▲, proposed ○, running ◐, unresolved ▮), 3 colors (line-strong, accent-dim, warning — defined but never called), 1 metric (idleAnimation). None reachable from any view. Delete them or give them a renderer; a token that ships without a call site is a promise the UI does not keep.",
