                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "glyph.healthy is ● and means \"kernel durable\" in the footer. frame.ts:141 writes a literal ● in the hints line to mean \"working\". Same character, two states, two rows apart in the same frame. The glyph table exists to prevent exactly this, and the collision escapes it by bypassing the table.",
