                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "composer-view.ts:130 sets the composer rail to theme.activity when working and theme.focus when idle. Both resolve to #8BD5F7. The rail is the composer's only state channel and it never changes. idle → working is invisible at the input, and the only real signal is the hints line swapping to ● ACTIVE.",
